# CLAUDE.md example

Use subagents only when they reduce risk, not when they multiply chaos.

Defaults:
- read-before-write
- small diffs
- stop conditions
- independent diff review for important changes
- do not turn one request into a massive rewrite

## Read-only discovery subagent

For large repositories, use a read-only subagent to map relevant files before editing.

The subagent should not modify files. It should return an evidence map only.
